### TITLE ###
ViewportScrollsAndShowsBothHints
### DESCRIPTION ###
With six options and room for three, the initial frame offers only a down-hint,
and scrolling past the window drops the earlier options and gains an up-hint.
The counts in the hints are what tell a reader how far the list extends in each
direction.
### PROMPT ###
Pick
### OPTIONS ###
o1
o2
o3
o4
o5
o6
### HEIGHT ###
3
### KEYS ###
down
down
down
enter
### SELECTED ###
o4
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick
> o1
  o2
  o3
  ↓ 3 more
--- frame 1 (down) ---
Pick
  o1
> o2
  o3
  ↓ 3 more
--- frame 2 (down) ---
Pick
  o1
  o2
> o3
  ↓ 3 more
--- frame 3 (down) ---
Pick
  ↑ 1 more
  o2
  o3
> o4
  ↓ 2 more
--- frame 4 (enter) ---
Pick o4

### TITLE ###
EmptyPromptHasNoLeadingBlankLine
### DESCRIPTION ###
A picker with no title starts at the first option rather than reserving a line
for a heading that is not there.
### OPTIONS ###
Apple
Banana
### KEYS ###
enter
### SELECTED ###
Apple
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
> Apple
  Banana
--- frame 1 (enter) ---
Selected Apple
